AMENDEDANALYSIS
This bill exempts direct-pay health care facilities from certain licensing requirements and
policies in RSA 151:2-f as well as the moratorium on licensing and bed capacity in RSA 151:2, VI(a)
providedthatthefacilityisnotanursinghomeorskillednursingfacility. Thebillalsoestablishesa
patient's bill of right for direct-pay facilities and directs the department of health and human
servicestostudydirect-paymodels.
